Protocol context
----------------

ModeBar speaks the reverse-engineered Bose Message Access Protocol (BMAP) over
Classic Bluetooth RFCOMM. Understanding of BMAP packet layout and function
blocks drew on public open-source work, including:

- ANChor — https://github.com/JimmyCalhoun/ANChor
- bosectl — https://github.com/aaronsb/bosectl
- bozo — https://github.com/NerdySouth/bozo

Those projects retain their own licenses; ModeBar does not vendor their source.
See docs/protocol.md for what this app implements.
